# Vendored Monaco editor distribution (copied from monaco-editor/min/vs by
# frontend/scripts/copy-monaco.mjs). Treat as binary so git performs NO EOL
# conversion on any platform — these are upstream Microsoft build artifacts
# (editor + Web Workers) and must stay byte-identical to what `next build`
# would emit from node_modules. Marking them `-text` also keeps diffs quiet.
* -text -diff linguist-vendored
